# Fuzzel Fobble — the editor's compilation unit.
#
# `fcc --lsp` discovers this file by name and analyses exactly what it lists,
# so the editor resolves names the way a build does. A build is one backend
# or the other, so this file has to pick one — and it picks SDL2, the build
# that needs no download.
#
# To work on the raylib backend with live analysis, change the line below to
# @raylib.rsp. gfx_raylib.fc is the only file the choice affects; everything
# else in the program is in both units.
@sdl2.rsp
